`14-entropy-20260722`) from first principles: the quarter identity `Ω = 4S + 1 ⇒ Ω ≡ 1 (mod 4)`,
`Ω − 1 = 4S` (A1); the triality centre `S ≡ 1 (mod 3) ⇒ 3 ∣ Ω + 1`, `3 ∤ Ω − 1` (A2); the octant sector
